    "sections": {
        "description": "Business Store is a modern, lightweight, and responsive WordPress theme designed for businesses, corporate websites, agencies, startups, freelancers, portfolios, online stores, and professional service providers. Built with clean code and full compatibility with the WordPress Block Editor, it offers customizable layouts, multiple widget areas, block styles, wide and full-width alignment support, WooCommerce compatibility, SEO-friendly structure, fast performance, accessibility-ready design, and translation support. Whether you're creating a company website, showcasing your portfolio, or launching an online store, Business Store provides a flexible foundation for building professional and engaging websites."
    },
